        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "計画は順調。やつはこの中に！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The plan's working. They're in here!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユミア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yumia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "やつはミンツェの花まで焼かせて、本国へと\n戻ろうとしてる。ここで止めないと！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "They're even burning the Minze flowers to make their way back to the mainland. We have to stop them here!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うん。決着を付けよう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Right. Let's end this."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユミア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yumia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "――いた",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "—There!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ひっ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Eek!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユミア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yumia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "お前たちか",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So it's you..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "男性Ａ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Man A"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "邪魔をしているのは",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Who dare interfere..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "女性",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Woman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "にくい",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hate..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "男の子",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Boy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "にくい\u3000にくい\u3000にくい\u3000にくい\u3000にくい\u3000にくい",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hate... hate... hate... hate... hate... hate..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "操られた人々",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Controlled Villagers"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "み、皆さんが盾に……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Th-they're using everyone as shields...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レイニャ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lenja"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "コイツらを人質にしやがったのかよ。汚ねぇ……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Using them as hostages? That's low..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ルトガー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rutger"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ユミア！\u3000魔物だけ撃ち抜けないか！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yumia! Can you target just the monster!?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴィクトル",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Viktor"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ダメです！\u3000ここからじゃ、どうやっても\nあの人たちを巻き添えにしてしまう！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I can't! From this position, there's no way to avoid hitting the villagers!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユミア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yumia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "みんなをぶん殴って気絶させたらどう！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What if we knock everyone out!?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "全員大人しくさせる間に、何かされちゃうかも！\n慎重に行ったほうがいいわ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "They might do something while we're trying to subdue everyone! We need to be careful!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ニーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Nina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "考えろ……っ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Think... think..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（アタシたちは、奴に刺さってる石を砕けばいいだけ。\n\u3000問題は、どうしたら人質を引き剥がせるかだ）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(We just need to destroy the stone embedded in it. The problem is how to separate it from the hostages.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "簡単な解析ですが、石はマナと極めて類似した物質を\n発信、または受信する性質を備えているようです",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "From my basic analysis, the stone appears to transmit or receive a substance remarkably similar to mana."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "フラミィ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Flammi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ユミアは、マナの流れを見て、舞を踊ることで\n流れを正常に戻すんだ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yumia can see mana flows and normalize them through her dance."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴィクトル",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Viktor"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（石は……マナに似た物質を発信……マナの流れ。\n\u3000これを変えることができれば……）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(The stone... emits a mana-like substance... mana flow. If we could change that...)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ユミア……舞える？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yumia... can you dance?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "えっ？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Huh?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユミア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yumia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "石の流れを変えられれば、人質になってる人の隙が――",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "If we can alter the stone's flow, there might be an opening among the hostages—"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユミア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yumia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "分かった！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I understand!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユミア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yumia"
        }
      }
    }
  }
